ties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5.1<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">December 23, 1999<br/>Beta 5.1</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20171030111821&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Scale_Armor_e6c53b.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a scale armor <span class=\"p-attributes\">(Arm:9)</span>.<br/>Classification: 1 Tier: 0.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 105.00 oz.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Scale Armor is often among a player's first purchases upon reaching the <a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20%28Continent%29\">mainland</a>.  Therefore, it is part of the so-called Noob Set. Rumor has it that it is also the armor of Sunrise (on <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a>). This can also be gotten by <a href=\"#/wiki/Flask%20of%20Rust%20Remover\">unrusting</a> a Heavily Rusted Armor and <a href=\"#/wiki/Rusted%20Armor\">Rusted Armor</a>.\nObtainable in the <a href=\"#/quest/scale-armor-quest\">Scale Armor Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-object-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>Before the winter update 2007 a Scale Armor looked like this: <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Scale Armor (Old)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height